</div></div></section></section></article><article class="sub-article" id="pdig.0000016.r003"><section class="pmc-layout__citation font-secondary font-xs"><div>PLOS Digit Health. doi: <a href="https://doi.org/10.1371/journal.pdig.0000016.r003" class="usa-link usa-link--external" data-ga-action="click_feat_suppl" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">10.1371/journal.pdig.0000016.r003</a>
</div></section><section class="front-matter"><div class="ameta p font-secondary font-xs">
<hgroup><h1>Decision Letter 1</h1></hgroup><div class="cg p">
<a href='https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/?term="Lu%20HHS"[Author]' class="usa-link" aria-describedby="id16"><span class="name western">Henry Horng-Shing Lu</span></a><div hidden="hidden" id="id16">
